WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:02.948
I call this your money autobiography,

00:00:02.948 --> 00:00:07.537
and&nbsp;as a money coach, this is
the first step I take with my clients.

00:00:08.465 --> 00:00:12.000
Think back to&nbsp;your earliest 
childhood money memory.

00:00:12.406 --> 00:00:14.447
What did it feel like 
when you got money?

00:00:14.911 --> 00:00:19.058
Were you excited, proud or confused?

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.867
And what did you do 
with the money?

00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:24.061
Did you run&nbsp;to the candy store,

00:00:24.061 --> 00:00:25.778
or did you run to the bank?

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.087
And what did you hear 
your parents say,

00:00:29.087 --> 00:00:32.454
and what did you see your 
parents do with the money?

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.676
Change is difficult,

00:00:36.441 --> 00:00:40.260
but in my&nbsp;family, not 
changing is fatal.

00:00:41.538 --> 00:00:43.130
So I did the work,

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:48.357
and I have experienced&nbsp;deep 
and profound forgiveness.

00:00:49.447 --> 00:00:53.477
It only takes one person in your family

00:00:53.477 --> 00:00:56.809
to break through the&nbsp;
money-shame cycle.

00:00:56.809 --> 00:00:59.809
I want you to be the one.

